<div class="think-comparison">
  <article class="think-lane think-lane--problem" aria-labelledby="ungoverned-flow-title">
    <header class="think-lane__head">
      <span class="think-lane__marker">Without governed THINK</span>
      <h3 id="ungoverned-flow-title">AI accelerates output, not understanding.</h3>
    </header>
    <ol class="think-flow">
      <li class="think-node">
        <span class="think-node__label">THINK</span>
        <strong>Intent stays implicit</strong>
        <span>Policies, architecture, constraints, and ownership remain open to interpretation.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="think-connector"><span>GenAI scales the ambiguity</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></li>
      <li class="think-node think-node--amplified">
        <span class="think-node__label">AI-ACCELERATED BUILD</span>
        <strong>More output, sooner</strong>
        <span>Code and artifacts multiply before their governing definition is settled.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="think-connector"><span>unresolved decisions move downstream</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></li>
      <li class="think-node think-node--warning">
        <span class="think-node__label">REVIEW + RUN</span>
        <strong>The control burden grows</strong>
        <span>Humans absorb more review, rework, exceptions, and operational risk.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </article>

  <article class="think-lane think-lane--poesis" aria-labelledby="governed-flow-title">
    <header class="think-lane__head">
      <span class="think-lane__marker">With Poesis</span>
      <h3 id="governed-flow-title">AI helps resolve THINK before execution scales.</h3>
    </header>
    <ol class="think-flow">
      <li class="think-node">
        <span class="think-node__label">INPUTS</span>
        <strong>Intent + observed reality</strong>
        <span>People provide purpose; systems and tools contribute evidence.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="think-connector"><span>AI helps source and structure</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></li>
      <li class="think-node think-node--governed">
        <span class="think-node__label">GOVERNED THINK</span>
        <strong>Explicit definitions</strong>
        <span>Humans govern what becomes authoritative, machine-operable, and actionable.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="think-connector"><span>shared definitions bound execution</span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></li>
      <li class="think-node">
        <span class="think-node__label">BUILD + RUN</span>
        <strong>Accelerated, bounded action</strong>
        <span>Humans, software, mechanisms, and agents act from the same reference.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </article>
</div>